@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title UC-Technical Administration — Configure and Monitor Technical Integrations
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

start
|Admin Technical|
:Authenticate through the approved technical-administration mechanism;
:Open technical configuration or monitoring area;
|System|
:Verify Admin Technical authorisation;
if (Technical operation requested?) then (configuration / integration / monitoring)
  |Admin Technical|
  :Configure approved technical settings or inspect integration health/logs;
  |System|
  :Apply permitted technical configuration;
  :Record technical audit event;
else (business-record mutation)
  :Deny request;
  :Record denied attempt in technical audit;
endif

note right
Admin Technical may manage configuration, integrations, monitoring and technical audit only. It must not change invoice, payment, order or other business records.
end note
stop
@enduml
